3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGzH01AFXRBOUL7MeucKV4P4SUzDcdMBkR9msau_8toYQ&oe=6A8D6A84"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Horror Hospital \u2013 The Escape Game", "keywords": ["Horror", "hospital", "escape", "story", "game"], "long_description": "It\u2019s the story of a horror hospital survival when you were driving the car in a secluded area and suddenly a car with very bright lights appeared in front of you and your car got out of control. You tried hard to control but finally stopped after hitting on the tree. In the broken windshield, you could see the car and just front corner was only visible with the first few letters of the word \u201cAmbulance\u201d. After that, you just being trapped and woke up in a hospital wardroom.\n\nNow you have to pick up \u201ckeycards\u201d and unlock doors to escape the hospital. You have to evade the Evil Doctor, like Mr. X. The Evil Doctor will follow you and once they see you then they\u2019ll never let you go safe outside. Keep silence and pick up the torch to find the door keys. You\u2019ve to keep yourself from jump scares. \nthat 1%?", "short_description": "Only 1% of people could escape through this horror hospital, so are you ready to become part of that 1%?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.bleedingedge.studio/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.bleedingedge.studio/privacy-policy.html", "publisher_name": "Bleeding Edge Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.bleedingedge.studio/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["HORROR", "ADVENTURE", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended